/** @mainpage

This suite exercises tsf-rtsp - an RTSP (RFC 2326) control client driven
from the Test Agent it runs on, over libcurl's built-in RTSP:

- @ref rtsp-probe - OPTIONS a configured endpoint (log its Public method
  set and Server header), then DESCRIBE it (log the status and the SDP's
  content-type). Control only - no media is streamed.

The endpoint is the test's to supply (env TSF_RTSP_URI, e.g.
rtsp://host:554/stream); with none configured the test skips cleanly. The
point is that tsf-rtsp drives RTSP over the library (not by scraping a
tool) and parses the reply into structured fields.

*/
